                                "text": "In short, the physician shifts from proceeding mostly by the extrospective route toward a combined extrospective and introspective approach toward the patient as a whole human being, thus building toward a person to person, doctor-patient relationship."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d2f3e9ad-38f3-4737-9ff8-b7a93579abad",
                                "sense_id": "66fb3cbf-bbed-378a-893e-ac2701b56347",
                                "text": "When it comes to understanding the subjective self, Kohut (1959) sees the introspective and extrospective methods as unequal in value."
                            }
